flowchart TD
    U[Citizen] -->|Register/Login| AUTH[JWT issued]
    AUTH --> CREATE["Create issue<br/>POST /api/issues"]
    CREATE -->|"e.g. 'Pothole on Main Road'"| VIEW["View issues<br/>GET /api/issues, /api/issues/my"]
    VIEW --> EDIT["Edit own issue<br/>PUT /api/issues/:id"]
    VIEW --> DEL["Delete own issue<br/>DELETE /api/issues/:id"]

    AUTH2[Admin] -->|Register/Login| AUTH
    AUTH2 --> ALL["View all issues<br/>GET /api/issues"]
    ALL --> TRIAGE["Assign priority + change status<br/>PATCH /api/issues/:id/status"]
    TRIAGE --> PROGRESS[In Progress]
    PROGRESS --> RESOLVED[Resolved]

    classDef citizen fill:#dbeafe,stroke:#2563eb;
    classDef admin fill:#fef3c7,stroke:#d97706;
    class U,CREATE,VIEW,EDIT,DEL citizen;
    class AUTH2,ALL,TRIAGE,PROGRESS,RESOLVED admin;
